flowchart TD
    A[Video input: sample.mp4] --> B[OpenCV frame reader]
    B --> C[YOLO face detector]
    C --> D[ByteTrack object tracker]
    D --> E[Face crop and InsightFace ArcFace embedding]
    E --> F{Match stored embedding?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Reuse visitor ID]
    F -->|No| H[Register visitor in SQLite]
    G --> I[Virtual line crossing logic]
    H --> I
    I --> J{Crossing direction}
    J -->|Left to right| K[ENTRY event]
    J -->|Right to left| L[EXIT event]
    K --> M[Save face crop and event in SQLite]
    L --> M
    H --> N[Save registered face image]
    M --> O[Write logs/events.log]
    N --> O
    O --> P[Display video and counters]
